KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* leading pack: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* after a type: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* several packs: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
A template argument list with explicitly specified elements of one pack and
deduced elements of a following pack is not represented: instantiation
splits the flat argument list positionally.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept
this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
